  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Slice zucchini into thin rounds.\n• Place zucchini on a lined tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-d1240e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-886de310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the zucchini has 10 minutes remaining, half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water and add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Cook spaghetti over high heat, until ‘al dente’, 9 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (see ingredients).\n• Drain spaghetti, then return to saucepan.\n• TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-f6548e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add light cooking cream, stock concentrate and the reserved pasta water, then simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat, then stir through roasted zucchini, lemon zest, a generous squeeze of lemon juice, the butter and cooked spaghetti until combined. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-e6f5bd30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, tomatoes, Parmesan cheese, pine nuts and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-aa36f440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roasted zucchini spaghetti between bowls.\n• Dollop over small spoonfuls of ricotta and basil pesto.\n• Serve with cherry tomato, Parmesan and pine nut salad and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-f7267250.jpg"
    }
  ]
